{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_012_04_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3b8fdecd154f8f522be0741d62df2c440ede4b437ed761f20d5224ba590f156d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6eca5bbb1fa78d35aa198d3e81e0dba68b9083054421ede6d539e7ce9a5b7d45",
      "text": "试镜场地",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19a0839e930e1d0a81092ef708f822f76d6886b43af638fa5a070e198b6289ea",
      "text": "各位原本在同一所学校担任教师啊。\n首先非常感谢各位的自我介绍！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7abe59d8c0bbd442d0dc64032519ce3d23d2e82a24a56c7b08e20bd514d26a7",
      "text": "那么接下来，请各位依次\n说说想要成为偶像的理由。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa8cbbf4657bacb7baef1de8d7c7862ef266a37fcf06b5f265af4532fee74fb0",
      "text": "为了让年轻人们萌生对学业的热情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fc83c209bc78d6657e3b15b7707acdf2cb835a7f477d612a6807c331835c316",
      "text": "之前作为教师，我一直都在做这方面的努力。\n但并不是用那种讲大道理的方法……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a4a13a85066f7904a408feb962c53cdcc0b44312083204d72e969aba666bd09",
      "text": "我呢，是因为被Mr. 硲邀请了☆\n觉得实在太exciting了，当天就……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:426cc0fecf38c69c4b2ce5c8b35161b7301346d9489f62484a1ae17e92184406",
      "text": "……听了他们的话，我就在偶像的世界里做起了发大财的梦。\n只是，在做的过程中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:204967dcf675b55e0b855356465f6c87ad5fc343583d33151292929f70d9fd7c",
      "text": "（……在之前的试镜里，\n也是这样一遍又一遍诉说着热情）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8240fc77bcf99c472ed76b1ae1c23d2fe11fd699669360c8e4ed392378af7f4b",
      "text": "（结果落得个10连败。投过的所有地方都没通过。\n……类虽然那么说）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9497dd634e0a7eaf3c9cd0a44f3990734aa6a213b61f65fc06d8b0cc4b200372",
      "text": "（也必须得考虑一下这次要是也不行该怎么办了呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000179:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78ea47ace5d2ce1888003ff17304546256b101e74ff41575dbeaca29af22f560",
      "text": "感谢各位的分享！\n那么，到这里就结束了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000184:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f64b1c889db2317abfb2ccd069b5a1805df913b47957ef7c6350d0f6a94f0e55",
      "text": "……不。为了传达我们的心意，\n还有一个东西，希望您能过目。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000200:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e519d6e78f9edb0f768fafade2171cf23e88e4ce8a19c180e8a1f584b2cf0120",
      "text": "你们两个，准备好了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
